<title>GERMANY: Wella sells Anton Huebner unit.</title>
<headline>Wella sells Anton Huebner unit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German haircare group Wella AG said on Wednesday that it had sold its stake in Anton Huebner GmbH to Deutsche Beteiligungs AG.</p>
<p>In a mandatory bourse statement, Wella said Deutsche Beteiligungs AG has obtained a 100 percent stake in Anton Huebner as part of a managment buy-in.</p>
<p>Huebner posted sales of around 45 million marks last year, selling natural cosmetics as well as remedies for certain illnesses.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
